# What stays out of the .vsix.
#
# The published extension is three things: the manifest, the theme file and the
# icon, plus the README, CHANGELOG and LICENSE that the marketplace renders.
# Everything used to *develop* the theme is dead weight in every install.
#
# Verify with `npx vsce ls`, which prints exactly what would ship.

.git/**
.github/**
.gitignore
.vscodeignore
.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**

node_modules/**
package-lock.json

# The icon is generated from the theme; the generator itself is not needed to
# use it, only to change it.
scripts/**

*.vsix
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
